<title>UK: Personal Number sets premium on market debut.</title>
<headline>Personal Number sets premium on market debut.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Personal Number Co. Plc rose to a premium over their issue price on Monday as the stock made its market debut.</p>
<p>The stock was quoted at 101-1/2p by 1424 GMT, compared with an issue price of 66p.</p>
<p>&quot;It has been a roaring success,&quot; said a spokesman for the company's broking adviser Beeson Gregory, &quot;you just couldn't ask for anything more.&quot;</p>
<p>Personal Number's service allows a client to be contacted on the same phone number while moving between different locations.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
